| **CreateMemoComment** | Indirectly — calls `CreateMemo` internally | `server/router/api/v1/memo_service_comments.go:56` → `memo_service.go:108` |
| **UpdateMemo** | Only when `update_mask` contains `"content"` | `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:436–451` |

