## Call chain: write path

```
CreateMemo / UpdateMemo(content)
  → memopayload.RebuildMemoPayload                    [runner.go:74]
    → markdown.Service.ExtractAll(content)          [markdown.go:355]
      → service.parse(content)                        [markdown.go:116]
        → goldmark.Parser().Parse(reader)             [markdown.go:118]
      → gast.Walk(AST) → ExtractedData.Property       [markdown.go:371–411]
    → memo.Payload.Property = data.Property           [runner.go:86]
    → memo.Payload.Tags = data.Tags                   [runner.go:85]
  → store.CreateMemo / store.UpdateMemo               [memo_service.go:115 / :496]
    → protojson.Marshal(payload) → DB `memo.payload`
```

## Call chain: read path (lists/previews)

```
ListMemos / GetMemo
  → store.ListMemos / GetMemo  (payload JSON unmarshaled)
  → convertMemoFromStoreWithCreators                  [memo_service_converter.go:31]
    → memoMessage.Property = convertMemoPropertyFromStore(memo.Payload.Property)  [:47–50, :315–326]
    → memoMessage.Snippet = getMemoContentSnippet(memo.Content)                  [:76–80]
      → MarkdownService.GenerateSnippet(content, 64)   [memo_service_webhooks.go:83–89]
```

Property is **read from DB**; snippet is **recomputed from content** on every API response.

