## Summary

| Question | Answer |
|---|---|
| **Computation site** | `internal/markdown/markdown.go` (`ExtractAll`), orchestrated by `server/runner/memopayload/runner.go` (`RebuildMemoPayload`) |
| **Parser** | goldmark + GFM + `TagExtension` + `MentionExtension`; AST walk via `gast.Walk` |
| **Production triggers** | `CreateMemo` (incl. comments), `UpdateMemo` when `content` in update mask |
| **Exact properties** | `has_link`, `has_task_list`, `has_code`, `has_incomplete_tasks`, `title` (+ co-recomputed `tags`) |
| **Lists** | Filter predicates read persisted `payload.property.*`; no re-parse |
| **Previews** | Use `snippet` (on-the-fly `GenerateSnippet`), not `property`; `property.title` is stored but unused in web UI |
